#: src/introduction.md:1 src/reference/cli.md:5
msgid "wayvid"
msgstr "wayvid"

#: src/introduction.md:3
msgid "**A high-performance video wallpaper engine for Wayland compositors**"
msgstr "**适用于 Wayland 合成器的高性能视频壁纸引擎**"

#: src/introduction.md:5
msgid ""
"wayvid brings video wallpapers to Wayland, supporting HDR, multi-monitor "
"setups, and Steam Workshop integration."
msgstr ""
"wayvid 为 Wayland 带来视频壁纸，支持 HDR、多显示器设置和 Steam 创意工坊集成。"

#: src/introduction.md:7
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr "主要特点"

#: src/introduction.md:9
msgid "🎬 **Multiple Video Sources**: Local files, directories, Steam Workshop"
msgstr "🎬 **多个视频源**：本地文件、目录、Steam 创意工坊"

#: src/introduction.md:10
#, fuzzy
msgid "🖥️ **Multi-Monitor**: Independent or synchronized playback per display"
msgstr "🖥️ **多显示器**：独立或同步播放"

#: src/introduction.md:11
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"🌈 **HDR Support**: Full 10-bit HDR pipeline with automatic tone-mapping"
msgstr "🌈 **HDR 支持**：带色调映射的完整 10 位 HDR 管线"

#: src/introduction.md:12
#, fuzzy
msgid "🎮 **Steam Workshop**: Direct import of Wallpaper Engine video projects"
msgstr "🎮 **Steam 创意工坊**：直接导入 Wallpaper Engine 项目"

#: src/introduction.md:13
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"🪟 **Niri Optimized**: First-class support for Niri compositor with "
"workspace awareness"
msgstr "🪟 **Niri 优化**：对 Niri 合成器的一流支持"

#: src/introduction.md:14
msgid "🔌 **IPC Control**: Real-time control via CLI/GUI"
msgstr "🔌 **IPC 控制**：通过 CLI/GUI 进行实时控制"

#: src/introduction.md:15
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"⚡ **Performance**: Hardware-accelerated (VA-API/NVDEC), low CPU/memory usage"
msgstr "⚡ **性能**：硬件加速，低 CPU/内存使用率"

#: src/introduction.md:16
msgid ""
"🖼️ **Wallpaper Engine Style GUI**: Intuitive control panel with bottom "
"monitor bar"
msgstr ""

